 oderate pace with about 800 feet of elevation gain. Learn more about the M
 idstate Trail here: Map Room and Hike Resources | The Midstate TrailWe wil
 l begin in the morning. After this trip\, please join us for the TrailsFes
 t 2025 potluck social – including a gear swap – at the Wachusett Mount
 ain Ski Area parking lot at the Balanced Rock trailhead. Sign up for the p
 otluck here: https://activities.outdoors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UUN0000013wbZ
 2AQ/act00013115Proper hiking footwear (closed toed\, with laces\, in good 
 condition) is required as are water (at least 1 liter) and snacks as neede
 d.TrailsFest\, which has been held annually since 2018\, coincides with Na
